The generic starter pack now seeds 4 transfer control profiles (WE-LIMIT-1: 3
cumulative + 1 instrument), each a manual checker-activation step. StarterPackFlowIT
approved the 5 limit rules + 1 journey but not the 4 TCP profiles, so the run stayed
AWAITING_APPROVAL (4 pending) instead of COMPLETED. Added FakePlatform.activateTcp
(tracks the tcp/cumulative + tcp/instrument paths) and call it in the resume flow.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01T7N3j7DZxqshVcXjR8mEAN
